## User

Split a string on every occurrence of a separator character.

## Type

type
```haskell
splitOn :: Char -> String -> [String]
```

## Term

```haskell
splitOn c s = case break (== c) s of
  (as, []) -> as
  (as, _:bs) -> as : splitOn c bs
```

